@baseUrl = http://localhost:5489

### OpenAPI contract
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Versioned, filtered, sorted, paged API
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses?page=1&pageSize=2&search=core&sort=title

### Version 2 response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/courses?search=advanced

### Rate-limit exercise: send this request three times inside 30 seconds
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/limited
